From 45303465457440176faa579efaadcbeb15a7f625 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sam (local build)" <sam@local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:30:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] dde-emu: host-compilable core (frame build, CRC/E2E,
 schedule, lock FSM) + host test

dde_emu_core.c rebuilds each frame from the tables with live cycle
field, E2E counter/CRC8 and header/frame CRC, packs PIO words, computes
fire times from car reference frames and runs the reference lock FSM
(loss after >2 missing cycles, re-arm after 8 good cycles).
test_dde_emu_core checks the C code against captured vectors bit-exact
(strict 2 s set) and all run 5 frames when the capture is present.
---
